#: bell.cpp:83
#, kde-format
msgid "Bell Settings"
msgstr "घंटी बिन्यास "

#: bell.cpp:88
#, kde-format
msgid "&Use system bell instead of system notification"
msgstr "तंत्र अधिसूचना केर बदला तंत्र घंटी इस्तेमाल करू (&U)"

#: bell.cpp:89
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"You can use the standard system bell (PC speaker) or a more sophisticated "
"system notification, see the \"System Notifications\" control module for the "
"\"Something Special Happened in the Program\" event."
msgstr ""

#: bell.cpp:96
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<h1>System Bell</h1> Here you can customize the sound of the standard system "
"bell, i.e. the \"beep\" you always hear when there is something wrong. Note "
"that you can further customize this sound using the \"Accessibility\" "
"control module; for example, you can choose a sound file to be played "
"instead of the standard bell."
msgstr ""

#: bell.cpp:105
#, kde-format
msgid "&Volume:"
msgstr "आवाज निर्धारक: (&V)"

#: bell.cpp:106
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Here you can customize the volume of the system bell. For further "
"customization of the bell, see the \"Accessibility\" control module."
msgstr ""
"एतए अहाँ तंत्र घंटीक आवाज क' अनुकूलन कए सकैत छी. घंटी केर बाइली अनुकूलन क' लेल देखू \"पहुँच"
"\" नियंत्रण मोड्यूल."

#: bell.cpp:111
#, kde-format
msgid " Hz"
msgstr "हर्त्ज"

#: bell.cpp:113
#, kde-format
msgid "&Pitch:"
msgstr "पिचः (&P)"

#: bell.cpp:114
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Here you can customize the pitch of the system bell. For further "
"customization of the bell, see the \"Accessibility\" control module."
msgstr ""
"एतए अहाँ तंत्र घंटी केर पिच क' अनुकूलन कए सकैत छी. घंटी केर बाइली अनुकूलन क' लेल देखू  \"पहुँच"
"\" नियंत्रण मोड्यूल."

#: bell.cpp:119
#, kde-format
msgid " msec"
msgstr "मि.से."

#: bell.cpp:121
#, kde-format
msgid "&Duration:"
msgstr "अवधिः (&D)"

#: bell.cpp:122
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Here you can customize the duration of the system bell. For further "
"customization of the bell, see the \"Accessibility\" control module."
msgstr ""
"एतए अहाँ तंत्र घंटीक अवधि क' अनुकूलन कए सकैत छी. घंटी केर बाइली अनुकूलन क' लेल देखू  \"पहुँच"
"\" नियंत्रण मोड्यूल."

#: bell.cpp:125
#, kde-format
msgid "&Test"
msgstr "जांच (&T)"

#: bell.cpp:129
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Click \"Test\" to hear how the system bell will sound using your changed "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"\"जाँच\" पर क्लिक करू ई सुनबा क' लेल जे बिन्याससभ मे परिवर्तन केर बाद अहाँक तंत्र घंटीक "
"आवाज कहिना हाएत."

